1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,075
In fifteen oh three, a Florentine notary's son
began a portrait he would never quite let go of.

2
00:00:07,425 --> 00:00:13,350
He carried it with him for the rest of his
life, still adjusting it sixteen years later.

3
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:19,100
The same restlessness runs through his
notebooks, thousands of pages of it.

4
00:00:19,450 --> 00:00:25,050
He wrote them backwards, in mirror script,
and finished almost nothing he started.
